an a large multi-minute one; (4) rewrite not_ready_message so it no longer names 'budget too short' as a cause.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["T1"],"decision":"dropped","drop_reason":null,"evidence":[],"finding":"The plan's load-bearing capability assertion — that GreenHopper 'registers custom fields progressively' over time so a larger measured budget will cure the 62-cell setup errors — is unverified and is directly refuted by prior art the plan does not consult, including the very module it edits.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f9df7627b548ac494","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Fix plan (rebar-debug Phase 2) §2–§3 and 'Diagnosis' / 'Why the old gate worked'","norm_id":"n23bab51b3de709db","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","scenarios":[],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Abandon the budget-sizing hypothesis. The measured prior art shows the Epic fields are provisioned by the first Jira Software project create, not by elapsed time, so the correct fix is to move the field wait AFTER _create_scratch_project (in